        </span>
        <span class="mt-1 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-md text-zinc-400" title="Text (T)" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="lucide lucide-type h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16"/><path d="M4 7V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2"/><path d="M9 20h6"/></svg>
